[2026-03-14T21:07:44.315Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014eR7wVX7AcLMUqBVwwRoLL","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! Now I have all the information I need. Let me compile a comprehensive report for the user.\n\n## Summary\n\nI've thoroughly explored the LinearClone app structure and gathered all the information needed for writing Playwright tests for the Sidebar component. Here's a comprehensive report:\n\n### App Directory\n- **Location**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/`\n\n### Sidebar Component Files\n\n1. **Main Component**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/Sidebar.tsx`\n2. **Collapse Component**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/SidebarCollapse.tsx`\n3. **Styles**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/Sidebar.css` and `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/SidebarCollapse.css`\n\n### All Data-TestID Values\n\n**Sidebar main container:**\n- `sidebar` - the main aside element\n- `sidebar-nav` - the navigation container\n\n**Workspace header:**\n- `sidebar-workspace-name` - the clickable workspace header link\n\n**Main navigation links:**\n- `sidebar-link-my-issues` - My Issues link\n- `sidebar-link-inbox` - Inbox link\n- `sidebar-inbox-badge` - unread notification badge (only visible when unreadCount > 0)\n\n**Teams section:**\n- `sidebar-teams-section` - teams section container\n- `sidebar-team-{teamId}` - individual team wrapper\n- `sidebar-team-header-{teamId}` - team header button (toggles expansion)\n- `sidebar-team-links-{teamId}` - team sub-links container\n- `sidebar-link-team-issues-{teamId}` - Issues link under team\n- `sidebar-link-team-cycles-{teamId}` - Active Cycle link under team\n- `sidebar-link-team-projects-{teamId}` - Projects link under team\n- `sidebar-link-team-views-{teamId}` - Views link under team\n\n**Workspace section:**\n- `sidebar-workspace-section` - workspace section container\n- `sidebar-link-all-projects` - All Projects link\n- `sidebar-link-all-teams` - All Teams link\n- `sidebar-link-members` - Members link\n- `sidebar-link-labels` - Labels link\n- `sidebar-link-settings` - Settings link\n\n**Collapse toggle:**\n- `sidebar-collapse-toggle` - collapse/expand button\n\n### Component Structure\n\n**Sidebar Component** uses Redux for state management:\n- Dispatches: `fetchTeams()`, `fetchWorkspace()`, `fetchUnreadCount()`\n- Selects from Redux:\n  - `state.ui.sidebarCollapsed` - boolean for collapsed state\n  - `state.teams.items` - array of team objects\n  - `state.workspace.workspace` - workspace info\n  - `state.notifications.unreadCount` - unread notification count\n  - `state.auth.token` - authentication token\n\n**Key Functions:**\n- `toggleTeam(teamId)` - toggles team expansion state (internal component state)\n- `isActive(path)` - checks if current route matches path\n- `isTeamActive(teamId, sub)` - checks if current route is a team sub-page\n\n**SidebarCollapse Component:**\n- Dispatches: `toggleSidebar()` from Redux `uiSlice`\n- Reads: `state.ui.sidebarCollapsed` from Redux\n\n### Navigation Routes\n\nThe sidebar links to these authenticated routes (defined in `App.tsx`):\n- `/my-issues` - My Issues page\n- `/inbox` - Inbox page\n- `/team/:teamId/issues` - Team Issues\n- `/team/:teamId/cycles` - Active Cycle\n- `/team/:teamId/projects` - Team Projects\n- `/team/:teamId/views` - Team Views\n- `/projects` - All Projects\n- `/settings/teams` - All Teams\n- `/settings/members` - Members\n- `/settings/labels` - Labels\n- `/settings` - Settings\n\n### Sidebar State Persistence\n\n- Sidebar collapsed state is persisted to `localStorage` with key: `sidebar_collapsed`\n- State is read on app initialization from localStorage\n\n### CSS Classes for Testing\n\n**Main styling classes:**\n- `.sidebar` - main container\n- `.sidebar-collapsed` - applied when sidebarCollapsed is true\n- `.sidebar-link-active` - applied to active navigation link\n- `.sidebar-badge` - notification badge styling\n- `.sidebar-team-header` - team section header button\n- `.sidebar-chevron-expanded` - rotated chevron when team is expanded\n\n**Sidebar dimensions:**\n- Expanded width: `240px`\n- Collapsed width: `48px`\n- Transition: `150ms ease` for collapse/expand animations\n\n### Test Data from Seed\n\nThe app uses seeded test data in `/repo/apps/LinearClone/scripts/seed-db.ts`:\n\n**Teams:**\n- Engineering (`ENG`) - has 3 team members (Alice, Bob, Carol)\n- Design (`DES`) - has 2 team members (Alice, Carol)\n\n**Workspace:**\n- Name: \"Acme Corp\"\n- Default team: Engineering\n\n**Test Users:**\n- Alice Johnson (`alice@acme.com`, `password123`)\n- Bob Smith (`bob@acme.com`, `password123`)\n- Carol Davis (`carol@acme.com`, `password123`)\n\n**Notifications:**\n- Alice has 2 unread notifications (both unread=false in initial seed, can be modified)\n\n### Test File Patterns\n\nExisting tests use:\n- **Pattern**: `test.describe('ComponentName', () => { ... })`\n- **Locator pattern**: `page.getByTestId('test-id-name')`\n- **Navigation pattern**: `await expect(page).toHaveURL(/\\/route/, { timeout: 30000 })`\n- **Visibility pattern**: `await expect(element).toBeVisible({ timeout: 30000 })`\n- **Content pattern**: `await expect(element).toContainText('text')`\n- **Helper functions**: Create test users via API before each test if needed\n\n**Test file locations:**\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/login.spec.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/signup.spec.ts`\n\n### Playwright Configuration\n\n**File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/playwright.config.ts`\n\nKey settings:\n- `testDir`: `./tests`\n- `timeout`: 60000ms\n- `baseURL`: `http://localhost:8888`\n- `actionTimeout`: 15000ms\n- `fullyParallel`: true\n- Reporter: Replay.io with JSON and HTML output\n- Uses `@replayio/playwright` devices for Chromium\n\n### Sidebar Test Coverage (from docs/tests.md)\n\n**23 main Sidebar tests** and **8 SidebarCollapse tests** are documented in `/repo/apps/LinearClone/docs/tests.md` (lines 113-280):\n\nMain Sidebar tests cover:\n- Workspace header rendering and navigation\n- Main navigation (My Issues, Inbox) rendering and navigation\n- Inbox notification badge display/updates\n- Team sections rendering and collapsibility\n- Team sub-links navigation (Issues, Cycles, Projects, Views)\n- Workspace section links (All Projects, All Teams, Members, Labels, Settings)\n- Active link highlighting\n- Presence/absence on authenticated vs public pages\n\nSidebarCollapse tests cover:\n- Toggle button visibility\n- Collapse/expand animations\n- State persistence across navigation\n- Icon clickability in collapsed mode\n- Multiple toggle sequences\n- Team and workspace sections visibility in collapsed mode\n\n### Layout Structure\n\nThe authenticated layout wraps all pages with:\n```\n<div className=\"app-layout\" data-testid=\"app-layout\">\n  <Sidebar />\n  <main className=\"app-main\">\n    {/* Routes */}\n  </main>\n  <KeyboardShortcuts />\n  <CreateIssueModal />\n</div>\n```\n\n### Key Files Referenced\n\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/docs/tests.md` - complete test specifications\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/App.tsx` - routing and layout setup\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/slices/uiSlice.ts` - sidebar state management\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/scripts/seed-db.ts` - test data seeding"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a6e4494568a16b166 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 61317\ntool_uses: 27\nduration_ms: 38581</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"082cad4c-aeb8-4793-9f14-2c9a8624c360","uuid":"b737d74a-74d0-4726-8b39-28115a35547d","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"I need to understand the app structure for writing Playwright tests for a Sidebar component. Please:\n\n1. Find which app directory exists under /repo/apps/\n2. Read the docs/tests.md file in that app directory (look for test entries related to \"Sidebar\")\n3. Find and read the Sidebar component source code\n4. Find and read any existing test files (*.spec.ts) to understand the test patterns used\n5. Read the playwright.config.ts file\n6. Find and read the seed.sql or seed data file\n7. Read the app's routing setup (React Router routes)\n8. Look at the layout components that contain the Sidebar\n\nBe thorough - I need all data-testid values, navigation paths, component structure, and test patterns.","agentId":"a6e4494568a16b166","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! Now I have all the information I need. Let me compile a comprehensive report for the user.\n\n## Summary\n\nI've thoroughly explored the LinearClone app structure and gathered all the information needed for writing Playwright tests for the Sidebar component. Here's a comprehensive report:\n\n### App Directory\n- **Location**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/`\n\n### Sidebar Component Files\n\n1. **Main Component**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/Sidebar.tsx`\n2. **Collapse Component**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/SidebarCollapse.tsx`\n3. **Styles**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/Sidebar.css` and `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/SidebarCollapse.css`\n\n### All Data-TestID Values\n\n**Sidebar main container:**\n- `sidebar` - the main aside element\n- `sidebar-nav` - the navigation container\n\n**Workspace header:**\n- `sidebar-workspace-name` - the clickable workspace header link\n\n**Main navigation links:**\n- `sidebar-link-my-issues` - My Issues link\n- `sidebar-link-inbox` - Inbox link\n- `sidebar-inbox-badge` - unread notification badge (only visible when unreadCount > 0)\n\n**Teams section:**\n- `sidebar-teams-section` - teams section container\n- `sidebar-team-{teamId}` - individual team wrapper\n- `sidebar-team-header-{teamId}` - team header button (toggles expansion)\n- `sidebar-team-links-{teamId}` - team sub-links container\n- `sidebar-link-team-issues-{teamId}` - Issues link under team\n- `sidebar-link-team-cycles-{teamId}` - Active Cycle link under team\n- `sidebar-link-team-projects-{teamId}` - Projects link under team\n- `sidebar-link-team-views-{teamId}` - Views link under team\n\n**Workspace section:**\n- `sidebar-workspace-section` - workspace section container\n- `sidebar-link-all-projects` - All Projects link\n- `sidebar-link-all-teams` - All Teams link\n- `sidebar-link-members` - Members link\n- `sidebar-link-labels` - Labels link\n- `sidebar-link-settings` - Settings link\n\n**Collapse toggle:**\n- `sidebar-collapse-toggle` - collapse/expand button\n\n### Component Structure\n\n**Sidebar Component** uses Redux for state management:\n- Dispatches: `fetchTeams()`, `fetchWorkspace()`, `fetchUnreadCount()`\n- Selects from Redux:\n  - `state.ui.sidebarCollapsed` - boolean for collapsed state\n  - `state.teams.items` - array of team objects\n  - `state.workspace.workspace` - workspace info\n  - `state.notifications.unreadCount` - unread notification count\n  - `state.auth.token` - authentication token\n\n**Key Functions:**\n- `toggleTeam(teamId)` - toggles team expansion state (internal component state)\n- `isActive(path)` - checks if current route matches path\n- `isTeamActive(teamId, sub)` - checks if current route is a team sub-page\n\n**SidebarCollapse Component:**\n- Dispatches: `toggleSidebar()` from Redux `uiSlice`\n- Reads: `state.ui.sidebarCollapsed` from Redux\n\n### Navigation Routes\n\nThe sidebar links to these authenticated routes (defined in `App.tsx`):\n- `/my-issues` - My Issues page\n- `/inbox` - Inbox page\n- `/team/:teamId/issues` - Team Issues\n- `/team/:teamId/cycles` - Active Cycle\n- `/team/:teamId/projects` - Team Projects\n- `/team/:teamId/views` - Team Views\n- `/projects` - All Projects\n- `/settings/teams` - All Teams\n- `/settings/members` - Members\n- `/settings/labels` - Labels\n- `/settings` - Settings\n\n### Sidebar State Persistence\n\n- Sidebar collapsed state is persisted to `localStorage` with key: `sidebar_collapsed`\n- State is read on app initialization from localStorage\n\n### CSS Classes for Testing\n\n**Main styling classes:**\n- `.sidebar` - main container\n- `.sidebar-collapsed` - applied when sidebarCollapsed is true\n- `.sidebar-link-active` - applied to active navigation link\n- `.sidebar-badge` - notification badge styling\n- `.sidebar-team-header` - team section header button\n- `.sidebar-chevron-expanded` - rotated chevron when team is expanded\n\n**Sidebar dimensions:**\n- Expanded width: `240px`\n- Collapsed width: `48px`\n- Transition: `150ms ease` for collapse/expand animations\n\n### Test Data from Seed\n\nThe app uses seeded test data in `/repo/apps/LinearClone/scripts/seed-db.ts`:\n\n**Teams:**\n- Engineering (`ENG`) - has 3 team members (Alice, Bob, Carol)\n- Design (`DES`) - has 2 team members (Alice, Carol)\n\n**Workspace:**\n- Name: \"Acme Corp\"\n- Default team: Engineering\n\n**Test Users:**\n- Alice Johnson (`alice@acme.com`, `password123`)\n- Bob Smith (`bob@acme.com`, `password123`)\n- Carol Davis (`carol@acme.com`, `password123`)\n\n**Notifications:**\n- Alice has 2 unread notifications (both unread=false in initial seed, can be modified)\n\n### Test File Patterns\n\nExisting tests use:\n- **Pattern**: `test.describe('ComponentName', () => { ... })`\n- **Locator pattern**: `page.getByTestId('test-id-name')`\n- **Navigation pattern**: `await expect(page).toHaveURL(/\\/route/, { timeout: 30000 })`\n- **Visibility pattern**: `await expect(element).toBeVisible({ timeout: 30000 })`\n- **Content pattern**: `await expect(element).toContainText('text')`\n- **Helper functions**: Create test users via API before each test if needed\n\n**Test file locations:**\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/login.spec.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/signup.spec.ts`\n\n### Playwright Configuration\n\n**File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/playwright.config.ts`\n\nKey settings:\n- `testDir`: `./tests`\n- `timeout`: 60000ms\n- `baseURL`: `http://localhost:8888`\n- `actionTimeout`: 15000ms\n- `fullyParallel`: true\n- Reporter: Replay.io with JSON and HTML output\n- Uses `@replayio/playwright` devices for Chromium\n\n### Sidebar Test Coverage (from docs/tests.md)\n\n**23 main Sidebar tests** and **8 SidebarCollapse tests** are documented in `/repo/apps/LinearClone/docs/tests.md` (lines 113-280):\n\nMain Sidebar tests cover:\n- Workspace header rendering and navigation\n- Main navigation (My Issues, Inbox) rendering and navigation\n- Inbox notification badge display/updates\n- Team sections rendering and collapsibility\n- Team sub-links navigation (Issues, Cycles, Projects, Views)\n- Workspace section links (All Projects, All Teams, Members, Labels, Settings)\n- Active link highlighting\n- Presence/absence on authenticated vs public pages\n\nSidebarCollapse tests cover:\n- Toggle button visibility\n- Collapse/expand animations\n- State persistence across navigation\n- Icon clickability in collapsed mode\n- Multiple toggle sequences\n- Team and workspace sections visibility in collapsed mode\n\n### Layout Structure\n\nThe authenticated layout wraps all pages with:\n```\n<div className=\"app-layout\" data-testid=\"app-layout\">\n  <Sidebar />\n  <main className=\"app-main\">\n    {/* Routes */}\n  </main>\n  <KeyboardShortcuts />\n  <CreateIssueModal />\n</div>\n```\n\n### Key Files Referenced\n\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/docs/tests.md` - complete test specifications\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/App.tsx` - routing and layout setup\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/slices/uiSlice.ts` - sidebar state management\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/scripts/seed-db.ts` - test data seeding"}],"totalDurationMs":38581,"totalTokens":61317,"totalToolUseCount":27,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5771,"cache_read_input_tokens":53546,"output_tokens":1998,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5771},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}}}
